WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.004
People just don't shop
at places like ours anymore.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.380
Yes, it's the same with us.

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:09.342
Why not? Your blades are top-notch, pops.

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:12.512
People can find everything they need
at shopping malls.

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:13.847
It might be time.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.058
We can't stand by
while our turf's being laid to waste!

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:19.644
Tatsu, what are you planning?!

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:20.979
THUD

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:22.147
I may not look it,

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.233
but I dabbled in some street selling
in the past.

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:27.152
Gather round, gather round!

00:00:27.235 --> 00:00:31.614
If you're not in a rush,
come over and have a listen!

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.491
What? What's this?

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:34.409
What's going on?

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:35.577
Some product demo?

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.788
Lo and behold, the all-purpose knife!

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:43.001
Made in Japan,
theland of pristine soil and seas!

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:45.795
This steel is on another level
to anything else!

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.673
Is it just another dull knife
where only the tip can cut?

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:50.800
Or can it even slice solid bamboo?!

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.802
It won't bend! It won't warp!

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.889
All this and it didn't even
blunt the blade!

